**Improving test coverage and auditing**

I'm thinking about streamlining the patch for better test coverage and optimizing tests without disrupting the frozen suite unless it’s meaningful. I want to verify read failures on missing blobs and consider adding real git read failures too. Also, I’m gathering existing test variations to audit comprehensively and planning to produce a human-readable report with detailed mutation results.
