I'm reviewing the retries for the "wrong-md5" case with canonical data to ensure all assertions pass correctly. I plan to combine various test variants into a single raw-text report using a Python script that captures command outputs and logs. I want to manage evidence files efficiently and include precise test failure counts before finalizing the report, keeping everything local and consistent.
